WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.767 --> 00:00:02.535
-I'm so happy. I'm so happy to
be in New York. This is great.

00:00:02.535 --> 00:00:05.372 align:start size:94% position:6%
Just like Jimmy,
just like you, I'm a dad.

00:00:05.372 --> 00:00:08.308 align:start size:94% position:6%
My son just turned 14.
[ Cheering ]

00:00:08.308 --> 00:00:09.042 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Which...

00:00:09.042 --> 00:00:12.312
which means I've got about 20
more years before he moves out.

00:00:12.312 --> 00:00:15.248 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
He's not going anywhere.

00:00:15.248 --> 00:00:17.217 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
I got a nice pool.

00:00:17.217 --> 00:00:20.053 size:84% position:42%
And he takes after me.
He's just like his dad.

00:00:20.053 --> 00:00:22.822 line:92%
When I was 14, same thing.

00:00:22.822 --> 00:00:25.725 align:start size:94% position:6%
Well, he's going
to summer school.

00:00:25.725 --> 00:00:27.360 line:92%
He's going to summer school

00:00:27.360 --> 00:00:30.130 size:75% position:38%
because he got a 1.8
in the eighth grade.

00:00:30.130 --> 00:00:32.899 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's like...
but here's the sad part --

00:00:32.899 --> 00:00:34.868 align:start size:94% position:6%
I threw him a party.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:34.868 --> 00:00:39.472
Because when I graduated
the eighth grade, it was a 1.7.

00:00:39.472 --> 00:00:42.842 align:start size:94% position:6%
I was like,
"Dang, you are smart!"

00:00:42.842 --> 00:00:46.212 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Applause ]

00:00:46.212 --> 00:00:47.781 line:92%
When he became a teenager,

00:00:47.781 --> 00:00:49.482 align:start size:94% position:6%
it's like
we stopped hanging out.

00:00:49.482 --> 00:00:51.418 align:start size:94% position:6%
We don't hang out
like we used to.

00:00:51.418 --> 00:00:52.419 align:start size:94% position:6%
It kind of sucks.
It sucks.

00:00:52.419 --> 00:00:55.522
When he was like 12, we used to
hang out all the time.

00:00:55.522 --> 00:00:56.790 align:start size:94% position:6%
We used to
go to the mall together,

00:00:56.790 --> 00:00:59.159 align:start size:94% position:6%
go to Foot Locker,
buy matching Jordans,

00:00:59.159 --> 00:01:02.128 align:start size:94% position:6%
walk out like a Puffy video
like, "Ah!"

00:01:02.128 --> 00:01:04.431 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
and on and on.

00:01:04.431 --> 00:01:06.166 align:start size:94% position:6%
Now we go to the mall
and my son just pulls up

00:01:06.166 --> 00:01:08.468
and he's like, "Dad, can you
pick me up in three hours?"

00:01:08.468 --> 00:01:13.940
And I just look at my son, I go,
"I don't have anywhere to go."

00:01:13.940 --> 00:01:15.508 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:15.508 --> 00:01:16.309 line:92%
"What do you want me to do?

00:01:16.309 --> 00:01:18.545 align:start size:94% position:6%
Do you want me
to drive around like --

00:01:18.545 --> 00:01:21.748 size:81% position:41% line:92%
What am I, Uber? Why?"

00:01:24.918 --> 00:01:27.087 size:81% position:41% line:92%
His new friend is Gus.

00:01:27.087 --> 00:01:29.789 align:start size:94% position:6%
Like, that's who he hangs out
with all the time.

00:01:29.789 --> 00:01:31.324 size:84% position:42% line:92%
Like we're not friends.

00:01:31.324 --> 00:01:34.794
He'll go to the movies and then
he'll come home at like 10:00

00:01:34.794 --> 00:01:36.429 line:92%
and then go right to his room.

00:01:36.429 --> 00:01:37.097 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
And then I'm like,

00:01:37.097 --> 00:01:38.731 size:84% position:42%
"You don't even want to
talk about the movie?"

00:01:38.731 --> 00:01:42.335
And then I'll follow him to his
room like a jealous girlfriend

00:01:42.335 --> 00:01:45.004 align:start size:94% position:6%
like, "Did you really
go out with Gus?

00:01:45.004 --> 00:01:46.239 size:84% position:42% line:92%
Like, who are you with?

00:01:46.239 --> 00:01:47.874 align:start size:94% position:6%
Oh, you don't want
to talk about it?

00:01:47.874 --> 00:01:52.145
Oh, you going to close the door?
Wow!

00:01:52.145 --> 00:01:54.447 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Wow!

00:01:54.447 --> 00:01:59.052 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'll wait out here.
Wow."

00:01:59.052 --> 00:02:01.554 line:92%
And he's not even sleeping.

00:02:01.554 --> 00:02:03.723 size:75% position:38% line:92%
He's Facetiming Gus.

00:02:03.723 --> 00:02:06.826
Because I got my ear pressed up
against the door.

00:02:06.826 --> 00:02:08.194 size:84% position:42% line:92%
I'm like, "I hear you."

00:02:08.194 --> 00:02:08.962 size:75% position:38% line:92%
And I open the door.

00:02:08.962 --> 00:02:11.364 size:81% position:41%
And I said something
I shouldn't have said.

00:02:11.364 --> 00:02:14.801
Like, it would have been cool
to say it when he was like 5.

00:02:14.801 --> 00:02:16.536 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
But, like, he's 14.

00:02:16.536 --> 00:02:18.938 align:start size:94% position:6%
And it was
the wrong thing to say.

00:02:18.938 --> 00:02:20.039 line:92%
I just opened up the door

00:02:20.039 --> 00:02:22.775 align:start size:94% position:6%
and go, "Hey, um,
I'm baking cookies."

00:02:22.775 --> 00:02:25.044 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:25.044 --> 00:02:27.247 size:84% position:42% line:92%
And my son goes, "Huh?"

00:02:27.247 --> 00:02:29.082 align:start size:94% position:6%
And then I go,
"I put milk in the freezer

00:02:29.082 --> 00:02:33.786
because I know you like freezing
cold milk with your cookies."

00:02:33.786 --> 00:02:39.392
And then I hear Gus on the phone
go, "Is that your dad?"

00:02:39.392 --> 00:02:43.062 line:92%
And my son goes, "Yeah, look,"

00:02:43.062 --> 00:02:45.265 size:88% position:44% line:92%
and he turned the phone!

00:02:45.265 --> 00:02:48.535 align:start size:94% position:6%
And they both
start laughing at me.

00:02:48.535 --> 00:02:50.937 size:75% position:38% line:92%
[ Laughs mockingly ]

00:02:50.937 --> 00:02:52.772 size:75% position:38% line:92%
So I started crying.

00:02:52.772 --> 00:02:57.844 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I go, "You know what?
I'm eating all the cookies!"

00:02:57.844 --> 00:02:59.846 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Applause ]
He's a jerk.

00:02:59.846 --> 00:03:02.715 align:start size:94% position:6%
Don't applaud him.
He's a jerk.

00:03:02.715 --> 00:03:04.317 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm going to take his phone
away.

00:03:04.317 --> 00:03:07.720 align:start size:94% position:6%
I pay the phone.
I'm taking the phone away.

00:03:07.720 --> 00:03:09.756 align:start size:94% position:6%
Because when I take
my son's phone away,

00:03:09.756 --> 00:03:12.025
it's like ripping his heart out
of his chest.

00:03:12.025 --> 00:03:15.595 align:start size:94% position:6%
My son physically breaks down
when I take his phone.

00:03:15.595 --> 00:03:19.532
I'm like, "Give me your phone!"
He's like, "Oh!

00:03:19.532 --> 00:03:23.136 align:start size:94% position:6%
What am I supposed to do now,
Dad?"

00:03:24.404 --> 00:03:26.839 align:start size:94% position:6%
I don't know what it is
when they turn 14.

00:03:26.839 --> 00:03:29.075
Like this is a great --
I'm on the "Tonight Show"

00:03:29.075 --> 00:03:31.644
and I can't wait to go back home
and see my son,

00:03:31.644 --> 00:03:32.745 line:92%
but I guarantee when I get home,

00:03:32.745 --> 00:03:34.948 align:start size:94% position:6%
he's going to be sitting
in front of the TV

00:03:34.948 --> 00:03:36.983 align:start size:94% position:6%
with his boxers on
and an Xbox headset

00:03:36.983 --> 00:03:40.687
and going to look at me and go,
"Did you get milk?"

00:03:40.687 --> 00:03:41.854 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:41.854 --> 00:03:44.290 size:84% position:42% line:92%
"Dad, did you get milk?

00:03:44.290 --> 00:03:45.858 align:start size:94% position:6%
Dad.
Hold on you guys.

00:03:45.858 --> 00:03:47.860 size:84% position:42% line:92%
Dad, did you get milk?"

00:03:47.860 --> 00:03:51.097 align:start size:94% position:6%
I love you guys.
Thank you so much.

